{title: Good Good Father (FJ_77_en)}
{song_number: 77}
{language: en}
{tempo: 144}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I have heard a [Gsus4]thousand [G]stories of what they think You are like,
[G]but I have heard the [Gsus4]tender [G]whisper of love in the dead of night.
[C]You tell me that You are pleased and that
[Am7]I am never a[D]lone.

{comment: Chorus}
[C]You are a good, good Father; it is who You [G]are, it is who You are, it is who You are.
[Am7]And I am loved by You; it is who I [Dsus4]am, it is who I am, it is who I am.

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]I have seen [Gsus4]many [G]searching for answers far and wide,
[G]but I know we are [Gsus4]all searching [G]for answers only You provide.
[C]Because You know just what we need be-
[Am7]fore we say a [D]word.

{comment: Chorus}
[C]You are a good, good Father; it is who You [G]are, it is who You are, it is who You are.
[Am7]And I am loved by You; it is who I [Dsus4]am, it is who I am, it is who I am.

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]Love so [Gsus4]undeniable, [G]I can hardly speak.
[G]Peace so [Gsus4]unexplainable, [G]I can hardly think
[C]as You call me deeper still into
[Am7]love, love, [D]love.

{comment: Chorus}
[C]You are a good, good Father; it is who You [G]are, it is who You are, it is who You are.
[Am7]And I am loved by You; it is who I [Dsus4]am, it is who I am, it is who I am.

{comment: Bridge}
[C]You are perfect in all of Your [Em7]ways,
[Am7]You are perfect in all of Your [G]ways,
[C]You are perfect in all of Your [Em7]ways to [Dsus4]us.

{comment: Chorus}
[C]You are a good, good Father; it is who You [G]are, it is who You are, it is who You are.
[Am7]And I am loved by You; it is who I [Dsus4]am, it is who I am, it is who I am.
